WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.179
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.449 --> 00:14.119
- I clearly warned you. - Give me a break.

3
00:14.202 --> 00:16.788
I never got a warning, even when I was doing track and field.

4
00:17.288 --> 00:21.000
Wouldn't you regret it… if you died doing something stupid?

5
00:21.084 --> 00:22.794
-

6
00:24.462 --> 00:25.380
Huh.

7
00:27.924 --> 00:29.425
This passageway,

8
00:30.301 --> 00:31.427
what's it for?

9
00:33.346 --> 00:35.431
Is it managing temps or something?

10
00:37.851 --> 00:40.478
- That's a trade secret. - Secret. Yeah, right.

11
00:40.562 --> 00:42.522
You're sure we'll find Hyeok-jun this way?

12
00:43.773 --> 00:46.151
Man, how much further is it gonna be?

13
01:00.832 --> 01:02.876
Is this the right place?

14
01:59.474 --> 02:02.393
DEAD-END JOB

15
02:03.686 --> 02:06.648
LAST CARNIVAL

16
02:15.615 --> 02:19.577
Welcome! Challenge! A Father's Miracle is starting right now.

17
02:22.288 --> 02:25.333
Gather your loved ones for this heart-warming, thrilling show.

18
02:25.416 --> 02:28.378
The whole family can enjoy Challenge! A Father's Miracle together.

19
02:28.962 --> 02:31.923
The father stayed up five nights in a row to practice

20
02:32.006 --> 02:34.884
so he could accomplish this in our studio today.

21
02:34.968 --> 02:37.637
The moment he does, the family's wish will come true.

22
02:37.720 --> 02:39.806
- Now… - This can't be real.

23
02:39.889 --> 02:40.807
…A Father's Miracle.

24
02:40.890 --> 02:43.851
It's now time to bring out our star, Mr. Byeon Min-su.

25
02:43.935 --> 02:45.603
Come on out!

26
03:02.537 --> 03:05.915
The father's mission today is to juggle while riding a unicycle.

27
03:06.916 --> 03:10.336
Will the father be able to make his family's wish come true?

28
03:24.851 --> 03:25.977
Dad!

29
03:29.731 --> 03:30.815
Hyeok-jun?

30
03:31.691 --> 03:33.151
Please, just stop it.

31
03:35.570 --> 03:36.696
Just stop it.

32
03:39.407 --> 03:40.992
Why are you… Oh…

33
03:41.993 --> 03:43.661
Why are you up there?

34
03:44.329 --> 03:45.663
Hey, you can't be there.

35
03:46.581 --> 03:48.041
Come on. Come on down.

36
03:48.541 --> 03:51.002
Hurry, Hyeok-jun. Come down. It's okay.

37
03:53.421 --> 03:55.298
Hyeok-jun!

38
03:57.675 --> 03:58.926
Ah, shi…

39
04:03.598 --> 04:04.515
Dad?

40
06:26.073 --> 06:28.910
I should just die. I should just die. I should…

41
06:28.993 --> 06:31.329
I should… just die.

42
06:32.497 --> 06:34.040
I should just die.

43
06:36.542 --> 06:37.460
Dad.

44
07:06.113 --> 07:07.323
No.

45
07:14.872 --> 07:16.499
"FANTASY" HAUNTED HOUSE

46
08:32.533 --> 08:35.244
Why are you hesitating when you're so close?

47
08:39.665 --> 08:40.916
Ms. Yeon-Joo.

48
08:41.000 --> 08:42.376
Are you going to open it?

49
08:45.129 --> 08:46.005
What's wrong?

50
08:47.214 --> 08:51.510
Is it because opening it may release monsters instead of your father?

51
08:56.515 --> 08:57.808
Or maybe

52
08:58.976 --> 09:01.479
it's because your father is now a monster?

53
09:05.608 --> 09:08.319
Tell me what's behind this door right now.

54
09:09.111 --> 09:10.571
The other world.

55
09:12.406 --> 09:14.325
But I don't remember it very well.

56
09:17.161 --> 09:19.288
I was trapped in darkness then.

57
09:20.581 --> 09:23.334
It was all I could think about for ages.

58
09:25.294 --> 09:27.046
Do you think it'll be the same?

59
09:31.217 --> 09:32.510
For your father?

60
09:57.284 --> 09:59.078
It seems things have gotten complicated.

61
10:00.204 --> 10:01.539
Move.

62
10:10.673 --> 10:13.467
You ruined everything!

63
11:00.723 --> 11:03.976
You really aren't much help. You know that?

64
11:04.727 --> 11:06.687
So, why don't you just wait here?

65
11:06.771 --> 11:09.857
I think not! I have to find my brother right now, jackass.

66
11:16.614 --> 11:17.782
Hey, Yeon-joo!

67
11:52.942 --> 11:54.693
You can't let them push you around.

68
11:55.694 --> 11:57.822
You've gotta put up a fight and get out of here.

69
12:00.491 --> 12:03.577
After almost dying that many times trying to make money,

70
12:05.204 --> 12:06.705
you still don't get it?

71
12:07.665 --> 12:10.167
You don't understand what kind of world this is?

72
12:15.631 --> 12:16.841
Step back!

73
12:18.384 --> 12:19.593
I'll buy some time.

74
12:20.094 --> 12:23.180
You have to open this door now. It's the only path out of here.

75
12:23.889 --> 12:25.891
The only path to change the world.

76
12:25.975 --> 12:28.227
Wh… What do you mean, "change the world?"

77
12:29.478 --> 12:30.479
No! Yeon-joo!

78
12:34.984 --> 12:36.777
If that door opens,

79
12:37.736 --> 12:40.823
everything from that world will have access to us.

80
12:41.490 --> 12:43.534
And they will come to destroy it all!

81
12:44.368 --> 12:45.703
Don't listen to him.

82
12:46.620 --> 12:49.832
There's nothing different about it. Everything from there was here first.

83
12:53.377 --> 12:54.378
Move.

84
12:56.630 --> 12:58.007
That woman is a monster.

85
12:59.174 --> 13:00.175
Move!

86
13:15.065 --> 13:16.901
You can go straight to hell.

87
13:24.491 --> 13:25.659
What?

88
13:34.084 --> 13:36.462
We meet at last.

89
13:43.969 --> 13:46.722
What the… No damage?

90
13:50.017 --> 13:51.310
Let go.

91
13:54.146 --> 13:56.357
I said let go!

92
14:02.863 --> 14:03.948
Stop it!

93
14:06.742 --> 14:08.243
Mr. Byeon Hyeok-jun!

94
14:08.327 --> 14:10.663
If you want to get paid, you need a job!

95
14:10.746 --> 14:12.873
Get a hold of yourself and work!

96
14:14.875 --> 14:16.794
It's money you need.

97
14:19.713 --> 14:21.507
You need to make money.

98
14:25.219 --> 14:26.136
Hey.

99
14:27.388 --> 14:30.724
Do you know how many people died because of your temp jobs?

100
14:30.808 --> 14:31.892
Huh?

101
14:38.482 --> 14:40.526
But I saved more people, didn't I?

102
14:42.027 --> 14:44.238
You guys were trying to die anyway.

103
14:44.738 --> 14:47.700
I made your worthless lives mean something greater!

104
15:02.965 --> 15:06.885
In order to save more people, we need to make more sacrifices.

105
15:09.263 --> 15:11.724
That's just how the world works.

106
15:13.559 --> 15:16.103
At least useless things like you

107
15:16.603 --> 15:18.731
can be helpful in this way.

108
15:19.398 --> 15:20.649
Don't you think?

109
15:22.109 --> 15:25.571
I paid you well, didn't I?

110
15:29.158 --> 15:30.784
Nothing is free in this world.

111
15:35.205 --> 15:37.207
They just wanted to live.

112
15:39.626 --> 15:40.711
What's that?

113
15:45.507 --> 15:47.968
Temp jobs didn't mean they had to die.

114
15:49.303 --> 15:51.305
They just wanted to live.

115
15:59.521 --> 16:01.815
You sound just like your dad.

116
16:08.822 --> 16:09.698
No!

117
16:23.462 --> 16:26.090
Oh no!

118
16:51.198 --> 16:53.909
How does it feel? To not be able to breathe?

119
17:01.750 --> 17:03.919
Now your heart's the one that stops.

120
17:26.817 --> 17:27.734
How…

121
17:30.404 --> 17:31.405
How did you…

122
17:32.072 --> 17:33.824
All thanks to you, Hyeok-jun.

123
17:35.868 --> 17:38.412
Now everyone will know what the world is like.

124
17:40.164 --> 17:41.498
What it's really like.

125
17:48.589 --> 17:49.882
Thanks to me?

126
17:50.799 --> 17:53.051
You believe the world will change by killing people?

127
17:53.135 --> 17:54.344
Forty years passed, you know…

128
17:57.014 --> 17:58.557
and this world hasn't changed.

129
17:58.640 --> 18:00.726
It's just gotten more complicated and rotten.

130
18:04.438 --> 18:06.732
This was proven to be the best way to put things right.

131
18:10.027 --> 18:12.529
Instead of one person dying unjustly,

132
18:14.072 --> 18:15.574
everyone dies.

133
18:17.326 --> 18:18.785
It's inevitable.

134
18:21.663 --> 18:23.540
I'm sorry for deceiving you.

135
19:18.136 --> 19:19.179
I'm here.

136
19:30.524 --> 19:31.650
Let's go back.

137
19:32.276 --> 19:34.361
We don't need any more money, so

138
19:34.945 --> 19:36.571
don't ever do jobs like this again.

139
19:37.155 --> 19:38.031
Let's go.

140
19:40.075 --> 19:41.368
No, no.

141
19:46.081 --> 19:47.249
I can't go.

142
20:09.187 --> 20:10.188
Excuse me.

143
20:13.400 --> 20:15.569
If you were to see my family,

144
20:17.195 --> 20:19.114
could you pass this on?

145
20:33.545 --> 20:34.796
It's not much,

146
20:35.297 --> 20:37.049
but please do that for me.

147
20:42.888 --> 20:44.056
By the way,

148
20:45.682 --> 20:47.309
you can't stay here.

149
20:49.436 --> 20:51.563
You'll end up like me.

150
21:00.405 --> 21:01.615
You have to go.

151
21:02.616 --> 21:04.451
Hurry, while you still can.

152
21:04.951 --> 21:06.078
Brother!

153
21:06.161 --> 21:07.371
Brother!

154
21:07.871 --> 21:10.457
Byeon Hyeok-jun, get a hold of yourself!

155
21:10.540 --> 21:12.834
Byeon Hyeok-jun, please. Get a hold of yourself, brother!

156
21:18.632 --> 21:19.549
Agh.

157
21:22.969 --> 21:24.054
Byeon Hyeok-jun!

158
21:27.265 --> 21:28.683
Please!

159
21:58.755 --> 21:59.589
Hey.

160
22:07.764 --> 22:08.723
Come on!

161
22:36.960 --> 22:38.086
Is it over?

162
22:50.140 --> 22:53.018
- Attention. A fire has been reported. - Let's go!

163
22:53.101 --> 22:56.771
Evacuate to the nearest safe area immediately.

164
22:56.855 --> 22:59.441
Attention, please. A fire has been reported.

165
23:01.026 --> 23:02.819
- Hey. - Come on! Open it!

166
23:02.903 --> 23:03.862
Hurry, hurry!

167
23:21.671 --> 23:22.797
Let's go home.

168
23:50.742 --> 23:52.035
The world didn't end.

169
23:55.455 --> 23:56.915
It didn't end,

170
23:58.875 --> 24:00.544
but it didn't change either.

171
24:03.296 --> 24:05.882
This is why I said we should hire another mover.

172
24:06.841 --> 24:07.842
Sorry about that.

173
24:09.553 --> 24:11.930
Wow. Exhausting.

174
24:12.013 --> 24:15.684
Yeah, but still, you're seriously pretty good, yeah?

175
24:15.767 --> 24:18.144
Have you found work as a temp before or something?

176
24:20.730 --> 24:23.191
A bit. I've done my share.

177
24:23.275 --> 24:25.735
The three of us live together again in a small home.

178
24:25.819 --> 24:27.779
FIRE HOT TTEOKBOKKI

179
24:27.862 --> 24:28.989
It's not all bad.

180
24:29.072 --> 24:30.532
- No, no, no! - What are you doing?

181
24:30.615 --> 24:31.575
All right, fine.

182
24:31.658 --> 24:33.326
When we gather to eat together…

183
24:33.994 --> 24:34.995
Why are you like this?

184
24:35.078 --> 24:37.497
…it almost feels like none of it ever happened.

185
24:37.581 --> 24:38.999
Put her outside.

186
24:41.960 --> 24:42.919
Although…

187
24:50.927 --> 24:52.137
…it wasn't just a dream.

188
25:09.696 --> 25:13.408
But now, it's all in the past.

189
25:13.491 --> 25:15.368
REDEVELOPMENT CONFIRMED

190
25:15.452 --> 25:18.330
DEMOLITION SCHEDULED, NO ENTRY

191
25:19.247 --> 25:20.832
Give me a smile.

192
25:21.958 --> 25:24.210
"I'm confident."

193
25:24.294 --> 25:26.254
That's it!

194
25:26.755 --> 25:27.714
All right.

195
25:27.797 --> 25:31.134
Good-looking guy. You'll find a job for sure.

196
25:31.217 --> 25:34.596
All right, all right.

197
25:52.072 --> 25:52.989
Hey.

198
26:04.626 --> 26:06.086
Hey, excuse me!

199
26:07.128 --> 26:07.962
Oh.

200
26:09.964 --> 26:10.799
Oh…

201
26:12.008 --> 26:13.051
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

202
26:13.134 --> 26:15.261
Whoa, whoa!

203
26:19.224 --> 26:20.308
Sorry.

204
26:23.561 --> 26:24.646
You all right?

205
26:26.773 --> 26:28.983
Why did you have to save me?

206
26:30.777 --> 26:31.736
Huh?

207
26:31.820 --> 26:32.946
I came here…

208
26:35.865 --> 26:38.326
…once I made my decision to end it.

209
26:41.121 --> 26:44.290
I don't know how I'm going to do this with no money.

210
26:45.625 --> 26:47.544
It might be hard, but this is, uh…

211
26:47.627 --> 26:51.089
But this is what?

212
26:51.172 --> 26:53.550
Oh, no, no. I was where you were a long time ago.

213
26:53.633 --> 26:56.261
See, I had no money. But not that I mean we're similar.

214
26:56.344 --> 26:58.263
Just, like, that I know…

215
26:58.346 --> 27:00.557
Uh, I mean, money is so…

216
27:01.266 --> 27:03.101
What I'm trying to say is, uh…

217
27:26.791 --> 27:27.834
Thank you.

218
27:49.189 --> 27:51.232
DO YOU THINK IT'S ALL OVER?

219
27:54.861 --> 27:55.945
Hyeok-jun.

220
27:56.821 --> 27:58.490
- The food's here. - Tteokbokki for you.

221
27:58.990 --> 28:01.743
- Thank you. - One sundae for you, and some fritters.

222
28:01.826 --> 28:03.995
- Amazing. Thank you. - Sure. Enjoy.

223
28:04.078 --> 28:07.582
…local residents on edge. Reporting now is Jeon Seon-ho.

224
28:07.665 --> 28:10.376
The police have launched a full-scale investigation

225
28:10.460 --> 28:11.878
into these mystery fires,

226
28:11.961 --> 28:13.963
but a cause has yet to be determined.

227
28:14.047 --> 28:16.174
According to the National Forensic Service,

228
28:16.257 --> 28:20.637
an unknown substance and unidentified DNA were found at the scenes of the fires.

229
28:20.720 --> 28:24.390
This is similar to the explosion at Kyungil Neo World.

230
28:24.474 --> 28:28.144
As these unprecedented and bizarre incidents continue to occur…

231
28:54.879 --> 28:55.922
Ah, sh…

232
29:10.186 --> 29:12.522
"Spider Staffing Agency manager."

233
29:12.605 --> 29:14.023
BASED ON YOUR PREDECESSOR'S REFERRAL

234
29:14.107 --> 29:16.025
"Recommendation from predecessor?"

235
29:16.109 --> 29:17.652
YOU HAVE BEEN SELECTED FOR THE POSITION

236
29:25.118 --> 29:26.327
Mr. Hyeok-jun.

237
29:27.245 --> 29:28.204
Ah.

238
29:29.080 --> 29:32.125
If you're listening to this message, I'm sorry.

239
29:32.625 --> 29:34.794
It means the balance has been broken.

240
29:36.337 --> 29:38.381
It couldn't have been entirely your fault,

241
29:39.007 --> 29:43.011
but if you take this position, you'll learn another truth.

242
29:44.804 --> 29:49.017
I'm curious to see if you'll come to a different conclusion than I did.

243
29:50.310 --> 29:54.355
So, are you sure you can live your life pretending not to know anything?

244
29:54.856 --> 29:57.859
Or… will you accept?

245
30:40.610 --> 30:41.486
Hm?

246
30:47.575 --> 30:50.411
Job interview… "Congratulations. You've been accepted."

247
30:50.495 --> 30:52.121
KYUNGIL GROUP 2025 SECOND HALF RECRUITMENT

248
30:56.459 --> 30:57.794
"Kyungil Group?"

249
31:01.297 --> 31:02.131
Hm?

250
34:50.735 --> 34:53.237
ALL NAMES, EVENTS, BRANDS, PERSONS, AND PLACES

251
34:53.321 --> 34:55.364
DEPICTED IN THIS SERIES ARE FICTIONAL

252
34:55.448 --> 34:57.742
ANY RESEMBLANCE TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
